    "detail": {
      "id": 1322202,
      "name": "Astra Yao - Hollow Symphony",
      "desc": "For every 25 Energy consumed, Astra Yao gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Starlight</color>, stacking up to 3 times. Each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Starlight</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases the DMG dealt by <color=#FFFFFF>Tremolo</color> by 15% when released and additionally released while she is in the <color=#FFFFFF>Idyllic Cadenza</color> state</color>. Holding <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to perform <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Finale</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Radiant Moment</color> consumes <color=#FFFFFF>Starlight</color>. Each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Starlight</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases the attack's DMG</color> by 15% and <color=#2BAD00>restores 4 Energy</color> to Astra Yao. When Astra Yao hits enemies with <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Interlude</color>, an additional 25 Energy will be consumed. When hitting enemies with <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Chorus</color>, <color=#2BAD00>an additional 4 Energy will be restored</color>.",
